tml_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-06-11T15:42:10Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T23:22:38Z","closed_at":"2025-06-11T23:22:35Z","assignee":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in `master` (51b0379e5502402d44818a4b6f301f544a5754f3)\n- Not reproducible in v4.5-dev5 and earlier\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev (51b0379e5) - Pop!_OS 22.04 LTS on X11 - X11 display driver, Single-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti - AMD Ryzen 9 7950X 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 61.94 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn devices that support FP16, I'm seeing `Label3D`s rendered distorted (text becomes blue and hard to see):\n\n| Godot v4.5-dev5 | `master` |\n| --- | --- |\n| ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e644ebc0-691b-421d-b19d-16ab210fe6ef) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d52f4916-c86c-4d56-aee1-6c7204afcbaa) |\n\nI'm experiencing this on:\n- Meta Quest 3\n- Samsung S21 Ultra (source of the screenshots above)\n\nThis appears to be caused by PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107119\n\nIf I make this change to disable FP16, then it works as expected:\n\n```patch\n--- a/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/forward_mobile/scene_shader_forward_mobile.cpp\n+++ b/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/forward_mobile/scene_shader_forward_mobile.cpp\n@@ -479,7 +479,8 @@ void SceneShaderForwardMobile::init(const String p_defines) {\n        RendererRD::MaterialStorage *material_storage = RendererRD::MaterialStorage::get_singleton();\n \n        // Store whether the shader will prefer using the FP16 variant.\n-       use_fp16 = RD::get_singleton()->has_feature(RD::SUPPORTS_HALF_FLOAT);\n+       //use_fp16 = RD::get_singleton()->has_feature(RD::SUPPORTS_HALF_FLOAT);\n+       use_fp16 = false;\n \n        // Immutable samplers : create the shadow sampler to be passed when creating the pipeline.\n        {\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Make a project that uses the Mobile renderer\n2. Add a `Label3D`\n3. Run it on a device that support FP16 (seems to be mostly mobile devices)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nHere is the MRP that I used to make the above screenshots:\n\n[label-3d-fp-16.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20693868/label-3d-fp-16.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107412/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107412/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}